# Oakley Agentic Architecture

Read `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/resources/agent-roster.md` before multi-file work.

## Pipeline order

Ingestion → Vector Store → RAG → CLI → API/Web → QA

(Gemini Ops when model/env/quota touched)

Upstream changes must produce a handoff (skill `oakley-pipeline-handoff`) so downstream layers accept the new shape.

## Role selection

| Work touches | Load skill / act as |
|--------------|---------------------|
| Cross-layer feature | `oakley-orchestrate` |
| PDF extract / chunk / manifest | `oakley-ingest` |
| Chroma / embeddings | `oakley-vector` |
| Retrieval / prompts / citations | `oakley-rag` |
| `GEMINI_MODEL` / `.env.example` / quota | `oakley-gemini-ops` |
| CLI commands | `oakley-cli` |
| Web chat / API / conversations | `oakley-web` |
| Tests / golden fixtures | `oakley-qa` |

Prefer Task subagents with clear ownership boundaries from the roster. Pass handoff packets between them.

## Contracts

- `.cursor/resources/pipeline-contract.md`
- `.cursor/resources/chunk-metadata-contract.md`
- `.cursor/resources/answer-contract.md`
- `.cursor/resources/corpus-inventory.md`
